WEBVTT

00:00:01.510 --> 00:00:03.530
<i>Deployment command from 
flagship confirmed.</i>

00:00:03.530 --> 00:00:06.810
<i>To Pursuit Unit: Code Uno and Code Due,</i>

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:08.340
<i>commence descent.</i>

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:12.370
<i>Naruto Wave confirmed at point lambda 
theta on the ley line interference belt.</i>

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:13.480
<i>Exercise caution.</i>

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:14.210
<i>Andare.</i>

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:20.310
So it's all automated 
up to this point, huh?

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:24.750
Now, I just have to be able 
to orchestrate this...

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:36.540
<i>Increasing sensitivity of 
gravity balancer by .03 m/s².</i>

00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:37.200
<i>Roger.</i>

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:38.530
<i>Falco Uno, andare.</i>

00:00:38.530 --> 00:00:40.080
<i>Falco Due, andare.</i>

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:41.070
<i>Target acquired.</i>

00:00:41.070 --> 00:00:42.300
<i>Making contact.</i>

00:00:58.120 --> 00:00:59.500
The Savior-King...

00:01:01.330 --> 00:01:02.810
It was inevitable!

00:02:38.930 --> 00:02:40.870
<i>It's Sir Da Vinci's newest model!</i>

00:02:40.870 --> 00:02:42.360
<i>Who's orchestrating it?</i>

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:43.510
<i>Apprehend it!</i>

00:02:43.510 --> 00:02:44.300
<i>Fire!</i>

00:02:48.760 --> 00:02:49.560
<i>The orchestration...</i>

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:52.060
Let me go!

00:02:52.060 --> 00:02:52.630
Shut up!

00:02:56.270 --> 00:02:58.260
<i>You are one chosen by the Armor.</i>

00:02:58.780 --> 00:03:00.810
<i>One beloved by dragons.</i>

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:03.600
<i>Feel the energy of the Armor.</i>

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:06.560
<i>Synchronize yourself 
to it and become one.</i>

00:03:06.560 --> 00:03:08.260
Who are you?

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:10.740
<i>Do not operate the Armor.</i>

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:12.220
<i>Perform in it.</i>

00:03:12.220 --> 00:03:13.290
Do not operate...

00:03:13.640 --> 00:03:14.560
Perform?

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:25.890
As if you could kill 
anyone with that stance.

00:03:26.270 --> 00:03:27.000
Huh?

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:33.160
<i>What?! Does he seek to oppose us?</i>

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:35.490
<i>We have no choice now! Finish him!</i>

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:40.350
If you want to live, stay put.

00:03:42.460 --> 00:03:43.120
Too slow!

00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:44.700
<i>What?</i>

00:03:55.490 --> 00:03:56.670
Prepare to die!

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:10.010
Amazing...

00:04:10.420 --> 00:04:12.300
Is he the Savior-King?

00:04:13.070 --> 00:04:16.250
Then I...

00:04:16.820 --> 00:04:21.350
came to this star... to meet him.

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:23.760
What now?

00:04:32.350 --> 00:04:34.050
I guess this jaunt is about to come to an end.

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:37.040
Nobu!

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:38.610
Nobu-sama!

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:40.710
Nobu, are you all right?!

00:04:41.430 --> 00:04:44.260
Yo, Mitsu, Monkey.

00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:47.330
Nobu-sama!

00:04:47.330 --> 00:04:48.280
Are you hurt?

00:04:48.730 --> 00:04:51.750
Nope, see for yourself.

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:54.670
You really had me worried.

00:04:56.790 --> 00:05:00.110
This is an excellent Armor.

00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:03.870
It was on that star-ship.

00:05:10.100 --> 00:05:12.250
Nobu, who is that girl?

00:05:12.730 --> 00:05:13.610
I don't know.

00:05:14.490 --> 00:05:16.360
She seems to be from 
the Star of the West.

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:22.710
Nice view!

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:23.950
<i>Wonderful!</i>

00:05:24.370 --> 00:05:25.800
<i>I'm most impressed!</i>

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:27.720
<i>I had no idea I would 
encounter you so soon!</i>

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:29.460
So loud!

00:05:29.460 --> 00:05:30.160
Who goes there?

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:35.240
<i>My theory that someone who could 
activate this new Giant War Armor</i>

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:37.000
<i>could be found on the Star 
of the East was correct!</i>

00:05:37.430 --> 00:05:39.970
<i>The celestial voice has 
guided the maiden!</i>

00:05:42.010 --> 00:05:45.240
<i>It is, in truth, 
alchemy beyond the stars!</i>

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:47.370
Just. Calm. Down!

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:49.080
Is that Armor yours?

00:05:51.900 --> 00:05:52.830
Si.

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:56.120
Vittorial Absolute Mark Dieci.

00:05:57.010 --> 00:06:00.300
It is a masterpiece born 
of my own workshop.

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:03.330
Da Vinci.

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:07.870
Ah, you live, Mademoiselle?

00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:10.030
Bravo.

00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:12.030
You were able to meet 
the Savior-King, no?

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:14.970
We can't be certain that he's the one...

00:06:15.460 --> 00:06:19.880
Let all come to pass in the flow 
of quanta and ley lines...

00:06:20.420 --> 00:06:22.710
We just need to find out the truth.

00:06:23.180 --> 00:06:25.710
Are you two from the Star of the West?

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:27.770
Si, Senore.

00:06:27.770 --> 00:06:32.190
I thank you all for saving 
us, people of the East.

00:06:32.190 --> 00:06:33.440
Don't worry about it.

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:35.070
It went both ways.

00:06:35.640 --> 00:06:39.290
But that Giant War Armor of 
yours suddenly stopped moving.

00:06:39.860 --> 00:06:41.370
Did I break something?

00:06:41.730 --> 00:06:44.290
No, there is no need for concern.

00:06:44.780 --> 00:06:46.120
Once it rests awhile,

00:06:46.120 --> 00:06:49.170
it should be able to synchronize 
with the dragon of this star.

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:52.970
The rest will follow once 
we obtain the Regalia.

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:55.370
That's good to hear.

00:06:56.470 --> 00:06:58.960
I am Oda Nobunaga of Owari.

00:06:59.510 --> 00:07:01.480
Let's hear your name.

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:05.720
I am Leonardo, of Vinci 
on the Star of the West.

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:09.370
Please call me Da Vinci.

00:07:11.670 --> 00:07:12.680
I am Jeanne.

00:07:13.130 --> 00:07:15.410
Just Jeanne?

00:07:17.430 --> 00:07:19.600
Jeanne Kaguya d'Arc.

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:20.530
I see.

00:07:20.530 --> 00:07:22.740
Jeanne, I have something to say.

00:07:23.950 --> 00:07:25.540
Next time you draw a blade,

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:27.190
be prepared to take a life with it.

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:28.610
There will be no second chance.

00:07:29.690 --> 00:07:30.950
That's the kind of place this star is.

00:07:32.330 --> 00:07:35.840
I serve Nobunaga.

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:37.810
I am Akechi Mitsuhide.

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:40.990
And I'm Toyotomi Hideyoshi!

00:07:40.990 --> 00:07:43.560
I may not look it, but I serve the Oda clan. I am hardly worthy, but—

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:44.610
Da Vinci-dono.

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:46.660
Here, on the Star of the East—

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:48.910
Hey, Mitsu...

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:51.940
The only location allowed 
to trade with your people

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:53.770
is Takamagahara.

00:07:54.220 --> 00:07:56.200
It seems you have your 
reasons for being here...

00:07:56.550 --> 00:07:57.630
Indeed.

00:07:57.950 --> 00:07:59.740
I'd be happy to explain.

00:07:59.980 --> 00:08:05.350
But is it not in our best interest 
to first depart from this place?

00:08:05.350 --> 00:08:07.720
We may encounter more pursuers yet.

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:25.570
I have heard that you are struggling to 
collect military funds, General Gupta.

00:08:26.170 --> 00:08:28.370
The problem lies with the wheat harvest.

00:08:28.780 --> 00:08:31.700
The waning of the ley line 
over the grain belt

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:33.610
occurred unusually early.

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:35.650
The same goes for my territory.

00:08:36.110 --> 00:08:40.650
This just underscores the urgency of our 
need to send an expedition to the East.

00:08:41.280 --> 00:08:42.620
General Hannibal,

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:46.860
The dragons of the two stars are not 
in harmony during this time of year.

00:08:47.350 --> 00:08:50.640
Sending a large fleet 
will risk their ire.

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:02.210
A dragon has awakened on 
the Star of the East.

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:05.110
A dragon?

00:09:05.460 --> 00:09:07.010
What is the meaning of this?

00:09:07.410 --> 00:09:12.500
We have a report from Admiral Magellan, 
who is in orbit around the East.

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:16.510
<i>I have failed you.</i>

00:09:16.510 --> 00:09:20.240
<i>Da Vinci has destroyed the two 
Giant War Armor units</i>

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:24.220
<i>that we deployed in pursuit 
and gone into hiding.</i>

00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:27.400
Does this have anything to do 
with the dragon's awakening?

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:30.870
<i>I am not entirely certain, 
but it is highly likely.</i>

00:09:31.180 --> 00:09:34.870
It was said that Da Vinci's new 
model could not be activated.

00:09:35.070 --> 00:09:39.060
What is that man planning 
to do in the East?

00:09:42.030 --> 00:09:43.840
Master Da Vinci must be found.

00:09:43.840 --> 00:09:47.850
I, Gaius Julius Caesar, would like 
the honor of that duty to be mine.

00:09:49.430 --> 00:09:54.160
Master Da Vinci has in-depth 
knowledge of Giant War Armor.

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:55.860
He is the most knowledgeable 
expert on this star.

00:09:56.300 --> 00:09:59.960
Now that he has betrayed us 
and sided with the East,

00:09:59.960 --> 00:10:02.760
he will most certainly cause us 
serious problems in the future.

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:07.570
Does anyone here object 
to General Caesar?

00:10:09.770 --> 00:10:13.790
Let us task General Caesar 
with the matter of Da Vinci.

00:10:16.150 --> 00:10:17.900
I trust you will prove 
worthy of the task.

00:10:18.390 --> 00:10:20.750
It is an honor, Your Majesty!

00:10:22.280 --> 00:10:25.720
Brothers of the Round Table, 
here gathered in Camelot...

00:10:26.690 --> 00:10:29.190
Let us make manifest a sacred world...

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:32.220
...and attain perfect harmony.

00:10:38.270 --> 00:10:41.840
I will leave Quadrant 15
 to you, Brutus.

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:44.080
I am going to the Star of the East.

00:10:44.650 --> 00:10:45.630
As you wish.

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:50.130
Come out!

00:10:50.640 --> 00:10:51.880
You were listening, weren't you?

00:10:55.260 --> 00:10:57.880
Our time has finally come, Nell.

00:10:57.880 --> 00:11:01.650
We can finally wave goodbye to 
this ancient star, Bianchi!

00:11:22.050 --> 00:11:24.920
They say all rivers lead to Oda.

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:32.550
It was fortunate that this 
trailer remained intact.

00:11:32.550 --> 00:11:33.810
At this rate,

00:11:33.810 --> 00:11:36.510
we should reach Owari's castle by sundown.

00:11:36.510 --> 00:11:38.830
So we should arrive in time for 
Nobukatsu-sama's coming of age ceremony.

00:11:40.190 --> 00:11:42.890
And to think I went hunting 
because I wanted to avoid it.

00:11:43.640 --> 00:11:44.570
Where are you going?

00:11:44.960 --> 00:11:47.630
I'm going to take a look 
at the Giant War Armor.

00:11:57.230 --> 00:11:59.480
Is this a wig?

00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:01.130
It's my actual hair!

00:12:02.060 --> 00:12:04.680
Is it that color because 
you eat gold or something?

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:08.580
I've heard that the Star of the 
West is swimming in gold coins.

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:10.370
So can you gimme some of that?

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:11.290
I refuse!

00:12:14.620 --> 00:12:17.270
Hey, is that rack real, too?

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:24.010
I guess I'll have to find out myself!

00:12:26.120 --> 00:12:27.480
Don't touch me!

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:33.210
I had no idea that the West had
 Giant War Armors like this at its disposal.

00:12:39.100 --> 00:12:40.990
Ow, man...

00:12:41.380 --> 00:12:43.760
That woman really packs a wallop.

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:46.430
Oh, where's Nobu-sama?

00:12:46.430 --> 00:12:48.520
I believe you just missed him.

00:12:48.520 --> 00:12:50.650
Oh, I see.

00:12:52.340 --> 00:12:55.430
Hey, is it hard to move this thing?

00:12:55.430 --> 00:12:57.730
No, it is not that difficult.

00:12:58.230 --> 00:13:00.740
Sir Hideyoshi, are you interested?

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:36.530
Are they unusual where you come from?

00:13:39.510 --> 00:13:40.990
Not really.

00:13:40.990 --> 00:13:43.950
Whether East or West,
 wing-horses look the same.

00:13:44.260 --> 00:13:45.190
I see.

00:13:46.010 --> 00:13:48.190
That's my horse, Onikage.

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:53.440
Why did you come to this star, anyway?

00:13:55.580 --> 00:13:58.770
I came to find my destiny.

00:14:00.300 --> 00:14:01.640
That's foolish.

00:14:02.540 --> 00:14:03.120
How?!

00:14:03.120 --> 00:14:04.820
Who decides someone's destiny?

00:14:05.350 --> 00:14:06.480
Are you going to spend your entire life

00:14:06.480 --> 00:14:09.550
following a "destiny" some 
complete stranger decided for you

00:14:09.550 --> 00:14:11.180
without your say-so?

00:14:11.180 --> 00:14:13.860
But that's what I must do!

00:14:14.310 --> 00:14:16.840
If I don't, disaster will befall my star!

00:14:16.840 --> 00:14:17.890
Disaster?

00:14:18.340 --> 00:14:19.630
What disaster?

00:14:20.220 --> 00:14:23.510
Well...  no one knows yet.

00:14:26.070 --> 00:14:28.510
Sounds like a wild goose chase to me.

00:14:29.530 --> 00:14:30.640
So?

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:33.500
How will you find your destiny?

00:14:35.010 --> 00:14:38.440
Well, the Savior-King...

00:14:42.010 --> 00:14:43.770
Nobunaga, you are—

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:45.240
Well, anyway,

00:14:45.240 --> 00:14:48.710
I need to name that Giant War Armor.

00:14:50.600 --> 00:14:54.730
People here call me the Great Fool.

00:14:55.220 --> 00:14:58.230
Hey. How would you say that 
in the Star of the West?

00:15:00.890 --> 00:15:02.130
"Fool"...

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:05.130
That's "fool" as in idiot, right?

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:06.970
This man...

00:15:09.810 --> 00:15:11.460
We'd say "fool."

00:15:11.460 --> 00:15:12.640
<i>The</i> Fool.

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:14.800
The Fool!

00:15:14.800 --> 00:15:16.110
That has a nice ring to it.

00:15:16.620 --> 00:15:19.570
I'll start calling him The Fool!

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:21.170
Pardon the interruption.

00:15:21.170 --> 00:15:23.320
Sure, what is it, Mitsu?

00:15:23.660 --> 00:15:26.830
I have named that Giant War Armor.

00:15:26.830 --> 00:15:27.590
From now on—

00:15:27.590 --> 00:15:29.740
It's about that Giant War Armor.

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:31.460
What are your thoughts on it, Nobu?

00:15:31.800 --> 00:15:32.770
Huh?

00:15:32.770 --> 00:15:33.600
Get to the point.

00:15:34.480 --> 00:15:37.390
When such an armor strides upon a battlefield,

00:15:37.390 --> 00:15:39.600
it has gone beyond the reach of man.

00:15:40.940 --> 00:15:44.070
Are we about to unleash something 
that must not be freed,

00:15:44.620 --> 00:15:47.510
and so render this 
world a living hell?

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:55.080
Hell, you say?

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:55.980
So be it!

00:15:57.210 --> 00:15:59.450
Then I shall become its demon lord.

00:16:03.470 --> 00:16:05.180
There is no stopping you, Nobu.

00:16:05.710 --> 00:16:08.300
What am I, then? The demon prison guard?

00:16:09.750 --> 00:16:11.360
Would you hate being a demon?

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:14.280
I can't say I would like 
wearing only a skin loincloth.

00:16:21.240 --> 00:16:23.780
You are great friends, I see.

00:16:24.310 --> 00:16:25.930
Ah, Da Vinci.

00:16:25.930 --> 00:16:27.520
Wait, who's steering the ship?

00:16:27.900 --> 00:16:30.290
I left it in Sir Hideyoshi's care.

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:31.490
Hideyoshi?

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:36.270
He is a very quick study.

00:16:37.170 --> 00:16:39.480
Can he really handle it?

00:16:40.920 --> 00:16:43.900
Monkey loves elaborate machines like this.

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:46.270
And what about you, Sir Nobunaga?

00:16:46.790 --> 00:16:48.900
Well, I guess I don't mind them.

00:16:49.150 --> 00:16:50.890
I see.

00:16:50.890 --> 00:16:51.800
In that case...

00:16:53.260 --> 00:16:55.070
Hm, what's that?

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:57.080
It is called a clock.

00:16:57.290 --> 00:16:59.890
There are others like it,

00:16:59.890 --> 00:17:03.530
but this is a special one 
that I created myself.

00:17:04.030 --> 00:17:06.770
Please accept it as a 
token of our friendship.

00:17:06.770 --> 00:17:07.620
Hm.

00:17:08.030 --> 00:17:09.690
How meticulous.

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:15.880
And I also offer my Giant 
War Armor to you, Sir Nobunaga.

00:17:18.110 --> 00:17:21.770
Although I am unworthy,
 I, Da Vinci, pledge you my aid.

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:24.900
Please make use of me as you 
see fit at the dinner banquet.

00:17:24.900 --> 00:17:25.870
Da Vinci?

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:28.740
And what do you wish in return?

00:17:30.950 --> 00:17:32.960
The truth of this universe.

00:17:35.310 --> 00:17:37.790
You're saying this truth 
of yours lies with me?

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:47.500
Try to find your truth, then.

00:17:48.890 --> 00:17:50.700
I would be most honored.

00:17:50.700 --> 00:17:51.950
Wait, Nobu.

00:17:51.950 --> 00:17:55.140
If you welcome people from the 
Star of the West to serve you,

00:17:55.140 --> 00:17:57.900
Nobuhide-sama and his advisers will 
surely have something to say about it.

00:17:59.080 --> 00:18:01.610
Forget those old geezers.

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:05.020
I do not speak only of Da Vinci-dono.

00:18:05.420 --> 00:18:07.480
We must consider Jeanne-dono, as well.

00:18:07.960 --> 00:18:08.950
Me?

00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:10.230
That's right.

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:13.350
How will you explain bringing her 
back to the castle with you?

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:15.880
I can just tell the truth, can't I?

00:18:16.460 --> 00:18:19.890
But consider what 
Ichihime-sama would think

00:18:19.890 --> 00:18:21.930
if she saw a lady like 
Jeanne-dono at your side.

00:18:23.780 --> 00:18:25.400
Ichi, huh...

00:18:29.570 --> 00:18:31.810
Would Ichi mind?

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:35.780
What to do?

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:48.260
From this day forth, you are a man.

00:18:48.260 --> 00:18:49.460
Your name is Ranmaru!

00:18:49.460 --> 00:18:50.930
R-Ranmaru?

00:18:51.880 --> 00:18:54.150
You smell of orchids, 
which we call ran.

00:18:55.770 --> 00:18:57.660
I've got an idea for something

00:18:57.660 --> 00:18:59.530
that should liven up Nobukatsu's 
coming of age ceremony.

00:19:00.480 --> 00:19:01.440
Lend me a hand.

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:05.370
A... man?

00:19:20.290 --> 00:19:23.230
I will be there soon, Fool-dono.

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:28.250
Nobukatsu-sama.

00:19:28.750 --> 00:19:31.870
I offer my heartfelt congratulations 
to you upon your coming of age ceremony.

00:19:32.360 --> 00:19:33.840
Congratulations!

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:39.340
Brother...

00:19:39.340 --> 00:19:40.240
Nobukatsu.

00:19:40.480 --> 00:19:42.460
Y-Yes, Father?

00:19:42.960 --> 00:19:47.810
From this day forward, you will 
 serve this clan as a man.

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:50.490
Forget about your fool of a brother!

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:57.440
Dad!

00:19:57.440 --> 00:19:58.890
The third fortress has fallen!

00:19:59.250 --> 00:20:01.860
Nobunaga! What is the meaning of this?

00:20:02.060 --> 00:20:03.720
Takeda is on the move.

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:07.690
The third fortress has fallen 
to a squad of War Armor units!

00:20:07.690 --> 00:20:08.840
Lord Shingen has taken action?

00:20:09.050 --> 00:20:11.130
Send scouts, now!

00:20:11.130 --> 00:20:13.340
They must discover Takeda's 
movements posthaste!

00:20:13.890 --> 00:20:16.170
Accept my gift to you, for your 
coming of age ceremony!

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:19.250
Brother, what is this?

00:20:19.680 --> 00:20:21.050
It is called a clock.

00:20:21.460 --> 00:20:24.610
It is a time-measuring device 
used in the Star of the West.

00:20:25.300 --> 00:20:26.420
Father,

00:20:26.420 --> 00:20:29.520
I have seen the battle with 
Takeda with my own eyes.

00:20:31.010 --> 00:20:35.160
I am certain that our current forces do 
not stand a chance against the Takeda.

00:20:35.160 --> 00:20:37.650
No, not just the Takeda.

00:20:37.650 --> 00:20:40.400
We also would fall before 
the Uesugi and the Mouri!

00:20:40.900 --> 00:20:42.870
Then what do you propose?

00:20:46.100 --> 00:20:47.280
What is that sound?!

00:21:00.080 --> 00:21:01.190
Wh-What is that?

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:02.970
It must be a Giant War Armor!

00:21:02.970 --> 00:21:05.630
Wh-Where did he acquire it?

00:21:05.630 --> 00:21:08.630
Father, this is a sign 
of things to come!

00:21:18.260 --> 00:21:20.210
It seems to reach the very heavens!

00:21:20.210 --> 00:21:22.940
It truly resembles a demon!

00:21:23.800 --> 00:21:25.360
Behold my power,

00:21:25.360 --> 00:21:26.480
my flesh and blood!

00:21:27.320 --> 00:21:28.970
The Giant War Armor,

00:21:28.970 --> 00:21:32.230
The Fool, has arrived!

00:21:34.330 --> 00:21:35.860
Nobunaga...

00:21:35.860 --> 00:21:39.460
do you intend to make yourself 
the king of this star?

00:21:41.410 --> 00:21:45.890
<i>You have brought back 
most unusual prey.</i>

00:21:46.690 --> 00:21:49.270
<i>Welcome home, Nobu.</i>

00:21:49.430 --> 00:21:51.160
Hey, Ichi.

00:21:51.160 --> 00:21:53.830
Look, it's a big one.

00:21:55.970 --> 00:21:57.700
What beauty!

00:21:57.700 --> 00:22:00.150
She is Aphrodite in the flesh!

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:03.360
Elle est mignonne...

00:22:03.770 --> 00:22:04.710
Who is she?

00:22:05.130 --> 00:22:09.460
She is Ichihime-sama, the younger 
sister of Nobu... Nobunaga.

00:22:10.130 --> 00:22:11.310
Sister.

00:22:16.380 --> 00:22:19.320
The answer you seek is here.

00:22:24.950 --> 00:22:26.090
The Lovers...

00:22:28.450 --> 00:22:29.710
Lovers...

00:24:12.610 --> 00:24:16.870
Test me to your heart's content, 
and see if I am truly worthy

00:24:17.480 --> 00:24:19.040
of ruling over Heaven and Earth.

00:24:19.520 --> 00:24:21.470
Next time: The Chariot.

00:24:22.190 --> 00:24:23.690
Come to me, Regalia!
